:"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-l1.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":176},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"9f4f786b9d2c17ba9167f627962e5ef9e2074eca4e7f6dc4e5f9b0800266cc32","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-l1.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":20789},"state":{"digest":"d5b40aabb981ecdf51bd680fa2fe692951f9527ae96fc5338877c69d948d5445","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-l1.1/state.json","size_bytes":183}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-l1.1","local_name":"sase-l1.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-l1","agent_clan_generation":"20260813134229","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-l1.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-l1[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]A monitor an agent starts must actually run[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A monitor started from inside an agent survives that agent's own [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]runner teardown, and when it cannot, the failure is loud and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]immediate: `sase monitor start` refuses to return success for a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]supervisor that is not provably alive, a monitor's workspace is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]never harvested out from under it, and a monitor's `--next` action [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]is never silently dropped.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]monitor_supervisor_survival.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/monitor_supervisor_survival.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-l1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-l1/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Supervisor survives its starter's teardown[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]detach[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detach: reparent the supervisor to PID 1 before `start_monitor` returns [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and set its signal dispositions in the first statements it executes, so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the starter's runner teardown cannot kill it during its startup window.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Monitor start is not reported until the supervisor proves it [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]is alive[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ack[dim] · [dim][/dim]after detach[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ack: have the supervisor publish a startup acknowledgement, block [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`start_monitor` on it, and turn a missing acknowledgement into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]torn-down member and a hard `MonitorError` the still-live starter agent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]can act on.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]A monitor's workspace claim cannot be harvested behind its [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]back[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]claim[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]claim: make the stale-RUNNING sweeper reconcile a monitor before [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]releasing its `ace-monitor` claim, and leave the claim alone when [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reconciliation fails, so a live lane's workspace is never handed to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]another agent.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The --next action survives a failed claim transfer[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]followup[dim] · [dim][/dim]after claim[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]followup: stop coupling the follow-up launch to a workspace-claim [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transfer that can no longer succeed, and give settlement an explicit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]degraded-launch outcome instead of dropping the follow-up.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]A stalled monitor lane is visible without reading done.json[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visibility[dim] · [dim][/dim]after followup[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visibility: surface dead-on-arrival supervisors and follow-up launch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failures in the ACE Agents tree, `sase monitor list`, and notifications,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and document the new guarantees.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end exercises for the agent-started monitor path[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]exercises[dim] · [dim][/dim]after detach, ack, claim, followup, visibility[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]exercises: drive a real agent-started monitor on every supported runtime[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and report what the CLI, the tree, and the follow-up agent actually did.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-l1","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-l1.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ca9010260f624f24b03f7479c396b676","started_at":"2026-08-13T17:43:30.533749+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"abd38c8a4157b93dcfb451d8f199a2a410426b6a37e59055e441c86cb031b0a4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-l1.2/chat.md","size_bytes":12970},"commits":{"digest":"b86b7e91721c47e9deb31efbc35a5c09d7a5081a1ea9361819c7ead06cf0eda0","pat